# kk: Declare variables without initial value 0 in SSA temporaries
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45954 state=merged
# ### What does this MR do and why?

<!--Describe in detail what your merge request does and why.-->


The Apple compiler took more than 10 minutes on large shaders (66,019
variables) and crashed. Now, by declaring variables without initial
value 0, it takes 42 seconds.

The variables are declared without initial 0. Removed the function
msl_def_is_sampler from msl_type_inference.c and msl_private.h because
it is no longer needed, since there is no need to give special
treatment to samplers, which were declared without 0.

* CTS: 56,319 subgroups, glsl, spirv and draw tests. No new failures
  compared to main. The only differences are in 12 float16 *_geom
  tests that are flaky: when repeated, all 12 pass, with and without
  the change.
* Hardware: M5 Pro, macOS 27.2.

Assisted-by: LLM
Original Language: ESP
